  "details": "One of my favorite features of Full Body tracking is using playspace mover. Be it using a small avatar to sit on someone's hand, or other posing opinions, it's one of my favorite benefits to FBT. My suggestion is to implement an official way to move your Avatar in the game space, but in a way that also allows you to move without requiring full body tracking. a playspace mover that works in normal VR, but still accounts for your IK as if you were standing normally on ground",
